// ser.cla: placeholder for the ported serialization runtime module (Plan
// 5b "Stage B" per docs/superpowers/specs/2026-07-29-runtime-migration-
// wave1-design.md). Task 4 (implicit runtime-module inclusion machinery)
// only needs this file to EXIST and be findable at the documented default
// location (runtime/clarus/, sibling of runtime/mac/) so that any program
// using file.save/file.load keeps emitting exactly as before -- file.save/
// load still lower directly to the existing rt_file_save/rt_file_load C
// runtime (rt.c), untouched by this task. Deliberately empty (no top-level
// declarations) so including it contributes nothing to a program's emitted
// C; Task 7 replaces this placeholder with the real ported serializer.
